; Rider — the messenger. He does not fight; he runs for the map edge, and if he
; gets there the levy learn exactly where you are and you lose 90 seconds.
;
; Proof that the stage 4 state-machine shape pays: Enemy, CharacterMotor,
; Health, Hurtbox, HitReaction and the Dead state are reused verbatim. The only
; new file in this enemy is Flee. He is taller and blue so he reads as
; different at a glance, and faster than the levy so chasing him is a real
; commitment.
;
; He keeps a Hurtbox and takes knockback on purpose: hitting him actually
; delays him, which is the only reason chasing is worth trying.
